{"n":104,"name":"Al-Humazah","meaning":"The Slanderer","ayahs":9,"startPage":601,"verses":[{"i":1,"ar":"وَيۡلٞ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٖ لُّمَزَةٍ","tr":"Waylun likulli humazatin lumazatin","en":"Woe to every scorner and mocker"},{"i":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِي جَمَعَ مَالٗا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","tr":"Allathee jamaAAa malan waAAaddadahu","en":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it"},{"i":3,"ar":"يَحۡسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخۡلَدَهُۥ","tr":"Yahsabu anna malahu akhladahu","en":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal"},{"i":4,"ar":"كَلَّاۖ لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِي ٱلۡحُطَمَةِ","tr":"Kalla layunbathanna fee alhutamati","en":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher"},{"i":5,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلۡحُطَمَةُ","tr":"Wama adraka ma alhutamatu","en":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher"},{"i":6,"ar":"نَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلۡمُوقَدَةُ","tr":"Naru Allahi almooqadatu","en":"It is the fire of Allah, [eternally] fueled"},{"i":7,"ar":"ٱلَّتِي تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلۡأَفۡـِٔدَةِ","tr":"Allatee tattaliAAu AAala alafidati","en":"Which mounts directed at the hearts"},{"i":8,"ar":"إِنَّهَا عَلَيۡهِم مُّؤۡصَدَةٞ","tr":"lnnaha AAalayhim musadatun","en":"Indeed, Hellfire will be closed down upon them"},{"i":9,"ar":"فِي عَمَدٖ مُّمَدَّدَةِۭ","tr":"Fee AAamadin mumaddadatin","en":"In extended columns"}]}